{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Past the Moon; Towards the Sun is a Contemporary or Modern Fantasy, Kinetic Visual Novel targeted towards new adult audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/about.png?t=1741812744\" /><strong>Story</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colleen\u2019s biggest worry was deciding on her future; torn between what her heart truely desired and what everyone told her she should do. But that all changed the night a stranger, cloaked in fur, dragged her into his life against her will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/bounce.gif?t=1741812744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Colleen as her adventure takes her for unexpected twists and terns as she pushes through her self-doubt and discovers her own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features fully animated Live2D characters, along with limited voice acting to help bringing the story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/group.png?t=1741812744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord server to connect with fellow fans, participate in discussions, and receive exclusive updates straight from the developers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3013160?t=1741812744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741812744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741812744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013